_eq_condExp"},"code":"/-- **Uniqueness of the conditional expectation**: any version of `μ[f | m]` agrees with it a.e.\nThis is `ae_eq_condExp_of_forall_setIntegral_eq` with the three hypotheses packaged. -/\nlemma IsCondExp.ae_eq_condExp [CompleteSpace E] (hm : m ≤ m0) [SigmaFinite (μ.trim hm)]\n    (hf : Integrable f μ) (hg : IsCondExp μ m f g) : g =ᵐ[μ] μ[f | m]","proof":":=\n  ae_eq_condExp_of_forall_setIntegral_eq hm hf hg.integrableOn hg.setIntegral_eq\n    hg.aestronglyMeasurable","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/Mathlib/CondExp.lean","start":59,"end":64,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/Mathlib/CondExp.lean#L59-L64"},"deps":[14],"outside":[],"external":[["CompleteSpace","mathlib","class"],["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instPartialOrder","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal.instTop","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Filter.EventuallyEq","mathlib","definition"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["LT.lt","lean4","definition"],["MeasurableSet","mathlib","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasurableSpace.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.AEStronglyMeasurable","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Integrable","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.IntegrableOn","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.instFunLike","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.instOuterMeasureClass","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.restrict","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.trim","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.SigmaFinite","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.ae","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.condExp","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.integral","mathlib","definition"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["NormedSpace","mathlib","class"],["PartialOrder.toPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Preorder.toLT","mathlib","instance"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.normedField","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddGroup","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddGroup.toContinuousENorm","mathlib","instance"],["Set","mathlib","definition"],["Top.top","mathlib","definition"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"directExternal":["CompleteSpace","Filter.EventuallyEq","LE.le","MeasurableSpace","MeasurableSpace.instLE","MeasureTheory.Integrable","MeasureTheory.Measure","MeasureTheory.Measure.instFunLike","MeasureTheory.Measure.instOuterMeasureClass","MeasureTheory.Measure.trim","MeasureTheory.SigmaFinite","MeasureTheory.ae","MeasureTheory.condExp","NormedAddCommGroup","NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","NormedSpace","PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","Real","Real.normedField","SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","SeminormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddGroup","SeminormedAddGroup.toContinuousENorm","UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace"],"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"626a0ba966ded368c52c5fcad1f75afbe62507b6","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":14,"name":"AlphaRAR.IsCondExp","kind":"Structure","keyword":"structure","module":"AlphaRAR.Mathlib.CondExp","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":false,"hashes":{"meaning":"33b314f29a008492","local":"dcfc49bff255b20f","content":"a4991e3e92baf34f"},"doc":"**`g` is a version of the conditional expectation of `f` given `m`.**\n\nThe measure and the sub-σ-algebra come first so that `Measure α` still elaborates against the\nambient `m0` rather than against `m`, and so that the characterized object `g` is the last\nargument. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"α","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"E","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedAddCommGroup","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedAddCommGroup E","typeRefs":[[0,18,"NormedAddCommGroup"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"NormedSpace","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"NormedSpace ℝ E","typeRefs":[[0,11,"NormedSpace"],[12,13,"Real"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":true,"name":"m0","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace α","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"MeasureTheory.Measure","implicit":false,"name":"μ","role":"variable","type":"MeasureTheory.Measure α","typeRefs":[[0,21,"MeasureTheory.Measure"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"MeasurableSpace","implicit":false,"name":"m","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace α","typeRefs":[[0,15,"MeasurableSpace"]]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"f","role":"variable","type":"α → E","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":true,"implicit":false,"name":"g","role":"variable","type":"α → E","typeRefs":[]}],"conclusion":"Prop","conclusionRefs":[],"decl":"AlphaRAR.IsCondExp","fields":[{"name":"aestronglyMeasurable","type":"MeasureTheory.AEStronglyMeasurable g μ","typeRefs":[[0,34,"MeasureTheory.AEStronglyMeasurable"]]},{"name":"integrableOn","type":"∀ (s : Set α), MeasurableSet s → μ s < ⊤ → MeasureTheory.IntegrableOn g s μ","typeRefs":[[7,10,"Set"],[15,28,"MeasurableSet"],[37,38,"LT.lt"],[39,40,"Top.top"],[43,69,"MeasureTheory.IntegrableOn"]]},{"name":"setIntegral_eq","type":"∀ (s : Set α), MeasurableSet s → μ s < ⊤ → ∫ (x : α) in s, g x ∂μ = ∫ (x : α) in s, f x ∂μ","typeRefs":[[7,10,"Set"],[15,28,"MeasurableSet"],[37,38,"LT.lt"],[39,40,"Top.top"],[43,44,"MeasureTheory.integral"],[53,55,"MeasureTheory.integral"],[63,64,"MeasureTheory.integral"],[66,67,"Eq"],[68,69,"MeasureTheory.integral"],[78,80,"MeasureTheory.integral"],[88,89,"MeasureTheory.integral"]]}]},"code":"/-- **`g` is a version of the conditional expectation of `f` given `m`.**\n\nThe measure and the sub-σ-algebra come first so that `Measure α` still elaborates against the\nambient `m0` rather than against `m`, and so that the characterized object `g` is the last\nargument. -/\nstructure IsCondExp (μ : Measure α) (m : MeasurableSpace α) (f g : α → E) : Prop where\n  /-- `g` is measurable for the smaller σ-algebra: it uses only the information in `m`. -/\n  aestronglyMeasurable : AEStronglyMeasurable[m] g μ\n  /-- `g` is integrable on every `m`-measurable set of finite measure. -/\n  integrableOn : ∀ s, MeasurableSet[m] s → μ s < ∞ → IntegrableOn g s μ\n  /-- `g` averages `f` correctly: it has the same integral as `f` over every `m`-measurable set of\n  finite measure. This is the content; the other two fields are what make it pin `g` down. -/\n  setIntegral_eq : ∀ s, MeasurableSet[m] s → μ s < ∞ → ∫ x in s, g x ∂μ = ∫ x in s, f x ∂μ","proof":"","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/Mathlib/CondExp.lean","start":37,"end":49,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/Mathlib/CondExp.lean#L37-L49"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instPartialOrder","mathlib","instance"],["ENNReal.instTop","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["LT.lt","lean4","definition"],["MeasurableSet","mathlib","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.AEStronglyMeasurable","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.IntegrableOn","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.instFunLike","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.restrict","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.integral","mathlib","definition"],["NormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","class"],["NormedAddCommGroup.toSeminormedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["N